# Power-on profile for lines 8 and 9 only (2959, 2960; the 2950 pilot hunts
# 2951 upward, so it reaches them last).  Installed as /etc/v90ras/profile.8
# and profile.9; lines 0-7 have no profile file and answer with the engine
# default (V.90 offered).
# x2 digital server for a client that speaks x2 (USR/3Com chipsets mark it
# with an inverted carrier at each V.8 CM preamble); docs/x2_implementation.md.
# docs/at_stored_profiles.md has the format.
power-on-profile 0
!
profile 0
 +MS X2,1
!
